Justice Boards. Similarly, inspection shall also be carried out by the District Magistrate in relation to the functioning of Child Welfare Committees.

43. Inspection and evaluation.- (1) The District and Sessions Judge shall be the Inspecting Officer of the activities of the Juvenile Justice Board under whose jurisdiction the Juvenile Justice Board functions.

(2) The District and Sessions Judge shall inspect the functions of Juvenile Justice Board at least once in six months and report to the Government and the High Court for follow-up.
